        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>녹비작물 － 호밀, 자운영, 베치</choice_text>
          <commentary>녹비작물의 예로 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>사료작물 － 옥수수, 티머시, 라이그래스</choice_text>
          <commentary>사료작물의 예로 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>약용작물 － 제충국, 박하, 호프</choice_text>
          <commentary>약용작물의 예로 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>유료작물 － 아주까리, 왕골, 어저귀</choice_text>
          <commentary>왕골과 어저귀는 섬유작물이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
